========================================================================
PLAIN ENGLISH (RULES 1.10)
========================================================================

**What is true**
DNS helpers that will eventually talk UDP should ask for the small
UDP permission token (`UdpCap`), not the broad network token alone.
Product `ooda/std/src/net/dns.oo` already takes `&UdpCap` on
`resolve_ipv4`. Real UDP socket DNS is still unfinished (localhost
hardcode + explicit Err residual).

**What is not true**
An older batch note (`std_caps_batch_2`) said five net servers were
migrated (`http_server`, `dns_server`, `mqtt`, `websocket`, `quic`).
Those files are **not on disk**. Citing them as CAP-G6 land evidence
is greenwash.

**What still is not done**
Product DNS resolver; full domain SysCap purge; OS isolation.
Human gate for push. Docs Cartographer does not push or re-close SPRINT C2.

